, {"file_name": "12.png", "id": "26778113288548783", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618896_26778113298548782_2248379806066760800_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LAA_iwW7XS4Q7kNvwH22EMJ&_nc_oc=AdrjO9NaFsY7Xzu1luH3kVevfJzrgOu3tHsNpNMwVsvpGP6q90oiMYxyhD8LPG-Dp28&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLjCBqdOxI4M_Y12aG1brwrjjMw67y7cjII624Oh2NZCg&oe=6AA3F487"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "857978200672533", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818885_857978204005866_2796147374153145821_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k66jQkmx3TcQ7kNvwEerG2x&_nc_oc=Adqvai4rnmzn5-J8HESSs7T8_vc9lTPnYU5GeZpT5eF0bGVnEiAlnV31OEMEFWUPDNs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLy3bTA1ZukWu5mAMiHPPce9ZpfZ-BsiS6eGJYg7GVJLw&oe=6AA40129"}, {"file_name": "11.png", "id": "5464232193802328", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623131_5464232197135661_3253032402275909037_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zm7X701HqgQQ7kNvwHq5WX1&_nc_oc=AdqOdA7Bo-vL6AyM2pVQf115YGAHgt68DjFql2TKaDhvPxzYyR6LmYW0t9D0IhBq7ho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQITzHle2LjRQReko9NXebOPea6hNMB4yGWuwWU--P3i-A&oe=6AA41C58"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Remembrance_landscape_cover_meta_2560x1440 (1).png", "id": "1717600335937677", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_1717600342604343_3370663257819765511_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CIlkXnnOyqQQ7kNvwH61psO&_nc_oc=AdqvqYa1InVGsE_AOsTLNBCs53InqUMxTmtGtgbgLWVAEvf73GfiDoC8odwH-lbA1c0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJuYcxxocqvexPeKyEPwqHpM4UsJDgk-MjhyuU26BLulw&oe=6AA41FF6"}, "display_name": "Remembrance", "keywords": ["puzzle", "adventure", "fantasy", "narrative"], "long_description": "# Unravel a Mind in Crisis. Chapter One.\nRemembrance invites you to dive deep into the fractured memories of Professor Isaac Nemeth, a brilliant but broken scientist whose work may hold the key to humanity's survival. Guiding Dr. Bell, a psychologist, you'll navigate surreal landscapes, solve intricate puzzles, and uncover haunting truths buried in his subconscious.\n\nThis is Chapter One of the Remembrance saga.\n# A World of Mystery and Emotion\nExplore a series of richly detailed, dreamlike environments that represent the professor\u2019s most pivotal and painful moments. From a star-filled childhood bedroom holding the promise of a bright future to the chaos of his shattered laboratory and a broken life, every memory offers a glimpse into the choices that shaped the man and the secrets he\u2019s desperate to hide.\n# Key Features: \n- **Immersive VR Gameplay**: Experience the game\u2019s intricate world and emotionally charged story from a fully immersive, first-person perspective.\n- **Thought-Provoking Puzzles**: Solve mind-bending challenges that mirror the professor\u2019s fragmented psyche.\n- **Emotional Narrative**: Dive into a deeply human story of ambition, loss, and redemption.\n- **Richly Crafted Worlds**: Traverse environments that blend memory, emotion, and a lifetime of regret.\n- **~1\u20131.5 Hours of Story:** A focused first chapter into Isaac's fractured mind.\n# What Truths Will You Uncover First?\nRemembrance is more than a game \u2014 it's a journey through the depths of memory, morality, and hope. Chapter One is where it begins.\n{997666959512873}", "short_description": "Chapter One of a mind-bending VR narrative puzzle saga. Step into the fractured mind of a dying scientist in Remembrance. Piece together broken memories, uncover devastating truths, and take the first steps toward a mystery that reaches far beyond one man's mind."}]}, "developer_name": "NIEKO", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://niekoplay.com/privacy-policy-remembrance/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name":